}}''[[General:The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim - Official Trailer|The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim - Official Trailer]]''  is a short [[General:Trailers|video]] created to reveal the [[Skyrim:Skyrim|fifth main game]] in [[General:The Elder Scrolls|the series]], and features many of the elements of the [[General:The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim Announcement Trailer|announcement trailer]]. Like the one before it, primarily features a depiction of [[SR:Alduin's Wall|Alduin's Wall]], with the [[SR:Music|main theme]] of ''Skyrim'' playing throughout the trailer. However, this trailer also features a battle between the [[Lore:Last Dragonborn|Last Dragonborn]] and a [[SR:Dragon|dragon]]. During the battle the dragon uses the [[SR:Fire Breath|Fire Breath]] [[SR:Thu'um|shout]], while the Dragonborn responds with [[Skyrim:Unrelenting Force|Unrelenting Force]]. There is also a few moments of gameplay showing [[SR:Combat|combat]] and scenery.

[[Skyrim:Esbern|Esbern]] narrates the following:

:''"You should have acted. They're already [[SR:Skyrim (place)|here]]. The [[SR:Elder Scroll|Elder Scrolls]] [[Lore:Prophecy of the Dragonborn|told]] of [[Lore:Return of the Dragons|their return]]."''
:''"Their [[Lore:Dragon War|defeat]] was merely a delay ... to the time after [[Lore:Oblivion Crisis|Oblivion opened]] ... when the [[SR:Stormcloaks|Sons of Skyrim]] would [[SR:Civil War|spill their own blood]]."''
:''"But no one wanted to believe — believe they even existed."''
:''"And when the truth finally dawns, it dawns in fire."''
:''"But ... there's one they fear."''
:''"In [[Lore:Dragon Language|their tongue]], he is "Dovahkiin." [[Lore:Dragonborn|Dragonborn]]!"''

